'''Pachirisu''' (Japanese: '''パチリス''' ''Pachirisu'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

