==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare card features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pachirisu}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Pachirisu|49}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Plasma''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Rocket's Zapdos|15}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

